OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought I just had a cold - but
OL,4,AI lost part of my leg to sepsis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Alex Plank developed
OL,7,Flife-threatening sepsis three years
OL,8,Fago, her family was told she was
OL,9,Funlikely to survive.
OL,11,FThe 41-year-old from Sheffield was
OL,12,Frushed to hospital, where she suffered
OL,13,Fa cardiac arrest in A&E before being
OL,14,Ftransferred to critical care.
OL,16,F"It was expected that I would die," she
OL,17,Fsays.
OL,19,F"My husband was told that, and he sat
OL,20,Fwith me because he was scared to leave
OL,21,Fme in case he didn't get to say
OL,22,Fgoodbye."
